# Source: Quizlet "A1 Basics Beginner Luxembourgish Lesson 7"

@lesson A1.07 "Food & Shopping"

# --- Food categories ---
@word d'Iessen = the food
@word d'Gedrénks = the drinks

# --- Vegetables ---
