# --- Stores ---
@word d'Epicerie = the grocery store
@word d'Bäckerei = the bakery
@word d'Pâtisserie = the pastry shop
@word d'Metzlerei = the butcher shop
@word de Supermarché = the supermarket
@word de Blummebuttek = the flower store
@word d'Post = the post office
@word de Maart = the market

# --- Restaurant ---
@word d'Menüskaart = the menu
@word d'Rechnung = the bill
@word den Dësch = the table
