@word de Klengen = the little one
@word d'Persoun = the person
@word d'Persounen = the people
@word de Bus = the bus
@word de Fliger = the plane
@word de Kaddo = the present

# --- Verbs ---
@word kafen = to buy
@word kéine = to buy
@word kaschten = to cost
@word verstoen = to understand
@word widderhuelen = to repeat
@word reservéieren = to book
@word huelen = to take
@word kréien = to get
@word bréngen = to bring
@word goen = to go
@word kommen = to come

# --- Useful words ---
@word allergesch = allergic
@word op Gluten = to gluten
@word presséiert = pressed for time
@word prett = ready
@word direkt = directly
@word natierlech = of course
@word wéini = when
@word w.e.g. = please

# --- Polite phrases ---
@word Et ass näischt = It's nothing
@word Villmools Merci = Thank you very much
@word Merci gläichfalls = Thank you, the same to you

